  "body": "**Link to problem area**: \r\n- https://spec.matrix.org/v1.8/client-server-api/#get_matrixmediav3downloadservernamemediaid\r\n- https://spec.matrix.org/v1.8/client-server-api/#get_matrixmediav3downloadservernamemediaidfilename\r\n- https://spec.matrix.org/v1.8/client-server-api/#get_matrixmediav3thumbnailservernamemediaid\r\n\r\n**Issue** \r\nThese don't mention 404 return code, despite this being reasonable and obvious.\r\n\r\n**Expected behaviour**\r\nSynapse returns 404 in some situations:  Synapse does this, e.g. https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/999bd77d3abb7b0a4430f31f5912956c3bc100ee/synapse/media/media_repository.py#L510\r\n\r\nso we should update the spec text to reflect this.",
